{
  "protocol": "Matched fixed weights and token prefix; alternating AB/BA one-token timings; three warmups excluded; 32 pairs; prompt prefill/reset outside timing; logits readback and synchronization included. CPU/GPU jobs serialized. Cold values are first use within this process, with driver disk caches left intact.",
